---
description: Keep docs/spec.md guarantees and kinds.GUARANTEES in sync
globs: docs/spec.md,src/ubiq/kinds.py,tests/test_kinds.py
alwaysApply: false
---

`GUARANTEES` in `src/ubiq/kinds.py` quotes sentences from `docs/spec.md` word for word.
`tests/test_kinds.py` fails when a quoted sentence changes.

- Edit a quoted spec sentence and its guarantee in the same change.
- When you add a `Context` member, add text for that region to the fixture document of the property test in `tests/test_kinds.py`.
